  "story": {
    "day": 83,
    "title": "Kaya's Island Trip Memories",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya got up on the thirteenth.",
      "She put on her jogging suit and T-shirt.",
      "Before breakfast, she looked at a mountain photo.",
      "Her kind aunt talked to them about it, and so on.",
      "\"They're spending the fourteenth and fifteenth on our island,\" she said.",
      "It was a national park. Many birds would fly there.",
      "Maybe Kaya would teach another Spanish subject recipe.",
      "It had avocado. She hoped to pass.",
      "Kaya packed her pants, volleyball, and racket for home.",
      "On the sixteenth, a man helped them get on the bus.",
      "After track and field, she wanted to bathe. Its warm bath felt good.",
      "Those memories lasted until the seventeenth. Kaya has them; she did not cry."
    ]
  }
